{"timestamp": 1779348929.6123872, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779348929.6133873, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779348941.495585, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve's body right in the middle of Electrical. \n\nMy route this round was Security, up to Weapons, back down through Security, and then I walked into Electrical to do my calibration task and found her there. Honestly, I haven't seen a single other person this entire round until I stumbled onto the body. \n\nSince I came from the Security side, the killer must have either vented or walked out towards Medbay, Cafeteria, or maybe Storage before I got there. Did anyone see someone heading away from the middle/left side of the map recently?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779348951.3879626, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started top left doing Upper Engine then Oxygen, then passed through Cafeteria and Medbay. I actually did pass through Electrical a little while ago and saw Eve alive, then I moved down to Security to do my cameras task. \n\nDiana, I didn't see you in Security, so you must have been up in Weapons while I was in there. Since I came from the Medbay/Cafeteria side before that, I didn't see anyone suspicious leaving Electrical that way either. The killer must have slipped away right after I left Electrical."}}
{"timestamp": 1779348968.4652612, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started the round in Electrical, then made my way through Medbay, up to Upper Engine, and finally Oxygen. I was in Electrical right at the start of the round, so Eve must have been killed after I left. \n\nWhen I was up in Upper Engine around the middle of the round, I saw Alice come up from Lower Engine. Frank, since you started top left and worked your way down to Electrical, we must have just missed each other in passing. If you saw Eve alive in Electrical late in your route, I was definitely far away in Upper Engine or Oxygen at that point. \n\nAlice, can you confirm we saw each other in Upper Engine? Let's hear from Alice and Bob so we can piece the rest of the timeline together."}}
{"timestamp": 1779348992.5960345, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started my route down in Navigation, went through Storage, and ended up in Medbay to do my scan task. \n\nI can definitely back up Charlie's story regarding Alice. Right at the very end of the round before the meeting was called, I saw Alice walk into Medbay coming directly from the Upper Engine hallway. That confirms her path down the left side of the map and puts her far away from Electrical when the kill happened. Alice is completely cleared in my book, and Charlie looks good too for corroborating it.\n\nThe real question here is between Frank and Diana. Frank, you claim you were the last to see Eve alive in Electrical, and then you went down to Security. Diana, you claim you came from Security to Electrical and found the body. It's highly suspicious that neither of you saw each other if you were both using the Electrical/Security corridor right around the time of the murder. \n\nFrank, you admitting to being in the room with Eve late in your route puts a lot of heat on you. I want to hear what Alice has to add since she speaks last, but right now Frank's story has the most holes. If we aren't 100% sure, we should skip, but Frank is my top suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349011.5557573, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I can completely confirm Charlie and Bob's stories. I started down in Lower Engine, moved up to Upper Engine where I crossed paths with Charlie just before he headed up to Oxygen, and then I went to Medbay where I met up with Bob right as the meeting was called. The three of us have solid alibis and are clear in my book.\n\nThat leaves Frank and Diana, and as Bob pointed out, their stories clash hard. Frank says he went from Electrical to Security to do his camera task. Diana says she came back down from Weapons, passed through Security, and went into Electrical to find the body. If Frank was hanging out in Security doing a task, Diana *had* to have seen him when she walked through. Yet Diana explicitly stated she hasn't seen a single person all round. \n\nOn top of that, Frank claimed he started in Upper Engine and Oxygen, but neither Charlie nor I saw him on that side of the map early on. Frank's story has way too many holes, and he admits to being the last one with Eve. I completely agree with Bob\u2014Frank is our top suspect. I'm voting for Frank."}}
